      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَحَنْفَفَةٌ</span></b>  One <i>who creeps along</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْحَفُ</span>) <i>upon
the ground,</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, K,) either from fatigue
or old age. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A man (TA) <i>whose
heel-tendons nearly knock against each other.</i>
(Ibn-'Abbád, K, TA.)

